WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.042 --> 00:00:02.043
YELENA:
I tell people my sister

00:00:02.043 --> 00:00:03.044
moved out west.

00:00:03.044 --> 00:00:04.629
♪♪

00:00:04.629 --> 00:00:05.922
YELENA:
You’re a science teacher.

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:09.384
YELENA:
Your husband...

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:11.261
he renovates houses.

00:00:13.096 --> 00:00:14.472
YELENA:
You’re thinking about moving

00:00:14.472 --> 00:00:15.557
but you’re gonna
wait until

00:00:15.557 --> 00:00:17.017
the interest rates
go down.

00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:18.351
NATASHA:
That’s not my story.

00:00:18.351 --> 00:00:19.352
[NATASHA laughs]

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:20.812
♪♪

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:23.314
NATASHA:
Before I was an Avenger...

00:00:24.399 --> 00:00:25.608
...I made
mistakes...

00:00:29.946 --> 00:00:31.072
...and a lot
of enemies.

00:00:36.745 --> 00:00:38.371
YELENA:
His call sign’s Taskmasker.

00:00:39.497 --> 00:00:40.749
YELENA:
He controls the Red Room.

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:42.250
YELENA:
They’re manipulated...

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:45.045
...fully conscious,
but no choices.

00:00:46.671 --> 00:00:48.338
NATASHA:
I should have come back for you.

00:00:48.673 --> 00:00:49.716
How many others
are there?

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:52.886
YELENA:
Enough.

00:00:54.471 --> 00:00:56.890
[Drumming intensifies]

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:57.974
♪♪

00:00:58.808 --> 00:00:59.809
NATASHA:
We have to go back

00:00:59.809 --> 00:01:00.810
to where it
all started...

00:01:01.519 --> 00:01:03.313
...so they never do
that to anyone again.

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:06.483
ALEXEI:
We are family...

00:01:06.691 --> 00:01:08.068
ALEXEI:
we fight with you.

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:12.705
MELINA:
You won’t win.

00:01:13.698 --> 00:01:14.824
MELINA:
I always found it best...

00:01:17.702 --> 00:01:19.287
...not to look
into the past.

00:01:22.332 --> 00:01:23.374
YELENA:
Okay, you got a plan

00:01:23.374 --> 00:01:24.709
or shall I just stay,
duck, and cover?

00:01:24.709 --> 00:01:26.544
NATASHA:
My plan was to drive us away!

00:01:27.003 --> 00:01:28.088
YELENA:
Well, your plan sucks.

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:31.299
♪♪

00:01:34.219 --> 00:01:35.220
NATASHA:
At some point we all

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:36.303
have to
choose...

00:01:37.847 --> 00:01:39.265
...between what the world
wants you to be...

00:01:39.766 --> 00:01:40.767
...and who
you are.

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:42.393
[Drums intensify]

00:01:43.269 --> 00:01:44.270
[Heavy gunfire]

00:01:44.562 --> 00:01:45.647
NATASHA:
I made my choice...

00:01:48.483 --> 00:01:49.734
NATASHA:
...I’m done running.

00:01:49.734 --> 00:01:51.319
♪♪

00:01:54.989 --> 00:01:55.990
YELENA:
Woo!

00:02:01.204 --> 00:02:03.623
♪♪

00:02:08.128 --> 00:02:09.129
NATASHA:
Here’s what’s gonna happen...

00:02:09.129 --> 00:02:10.421
MELINA:
Natasha, don’t slouch.

00:02:10.421 --> 00:02:11.421
NATASHA:
I'm not slouching.

00:02:11.421 --> 00:02:12.421
MELINA:
You’re going to get the back hunch.

00:02:12.421 --> 00:02:13.883
ALEXEI:
Hm, listen to your mother.

00:02:13.883 --> 00:02:14.884
NATASHA:
Oh my God this...

00:02:14.884 --> 00:02:15.883
ALEXEI:
Up, up!

00:02:15.883 --> 00:02:16.886
NATASHA:
Alright, enough. All of you.

00:02:16.886 --> 00:02:18.388
YELENA:
I didn’t say anything,

00:02:18.388 --> 00:02:19.388
that’s not fair.

00:02:19.388 --> 00:02:20.388
♪♪

